  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed: **a value after an emoji is read where it stands.** A record holding a character\n        outside the basic set, such as an emoji or a rare CJK character, had every value after it read\n        one character too early when the record was inserted, updated or loaded from the store. A key\n        field after one was refused as not a number, and a text field was indexed one character off,\n        its last character missing. Loading from a JSON file was not affected. Reload a dataset that\n        holds such records to have them indexed as written.",
